WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.120
Episode 15 - A Trap

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:41.200
This isn't going to work... they're going to turn me down.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.380
No, don't think like that!

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:46.960
It's better than not trying at all.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.920
I have to at least try!

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.790
Acting is the only thing I've got.

00:01:54.890 --> 00:02:00.620
So you're saying that you want me to cast you in a play, just like that?

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.570
I don't even know who you are.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:06.520
You're not in my acting troupe, yet you've come here,

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.470
expecting to get a part?

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:12.480
You're just a girl from junior high so you don't know how things work.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:15.960
I'm not being rude, but shouldn't you be leaving now?

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:20.590
It's not like I have trouble finding actors, you know.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.470
But my talents won't shine at all if I play that role!

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:30.400
Giving me that role shows exactly why I'd like to come to the forefront!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.460
And what's that supposed to mean?!

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.940
Every role is important!

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:41.190
I'm not trying to belittle the role, I'd just like to be more visible!

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.110
You want to be more <i>visible</i>?!

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:45.210
Miss!

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:46.740
Take five everyone!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:49.770
I need to get some air.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.930
You'd better hurry up and apologize!

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:56.530
Miss Harada is practically the head of the Promotions Board!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.630
I'll get my chance during the performance!

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.120
No, I didn't mean it like that!

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:08.220
I just meant that, if there was a role I could maybe do...

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:11.440
We don't need you; we have enough of our own actors!

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:13.780
Yeah, off with you.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:15.570
Take care!

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:19.640
What did that girl want?

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:22.970
She just showed up and asked if we could cast her in a play.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.250
She appears to be in Chigusa Tsukikage's troupe.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:28.380
Chigusa Tsukikage? You mean, of <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> fame?!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:33.580
But apparently, she told her that she isn't ready to play the role of the Scarlet Angel yet.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.810
<i>Yet</i>?

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:39.580
Tsukikage said that about her?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.770
She can't play the role <i>yet</i>?

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:52.640
Maybe I could get a job as a shop assistant...

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.260
I don't care for formal introductions.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:07.150
I was once a rival to Miss Tsukikage.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:09.230
She was always extremely disciplined when it came to acting.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:13.130
I hear you've been visiting a lot of troupes...

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.410
I have!

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:15.970
I'd like to try all kinds of acting!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.810
One day, I'd like to become a great actress!

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:23.010
Follow me.

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.540
Okay!

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.970
I want you to express these four emotions:

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:36.460
Happiness, anger, sadness, fun - and you can only use this.

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.730
You can ad-lib your lines. Now, go.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.760
I have to use a chair to express those four emotions...

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:46.440
Happiness. Anger. Sadness. Fun.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:51.920
A pleasant chair. A happy chair... Why would I be happy?

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:01.990
Wow, a brand new chair! Thank you, Mom!

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:05.070
My old chair was falling apart...

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:09.050
and it was getting really distracting when I was studying...

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:12.640
But what's this? It's got a huge scratch on it!

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:19.130
What kind of shop would sell it in this condition?!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:25.780
Man, it's just not my day. I was so happy to have been given a new chair, too...

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.820
But wait... I could just go down to the furniture store right now,

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:34.440
and tell them I want a new one.

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:36.950
Good.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.040
Thank you.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.930
That's satisfactory for now.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:48.620
Now, sit on the chair.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:58.260
How are you meant to sit on an upside-down chair?

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:01.030
Hurry up and sit down!

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:16.340
What's she doing?

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:20.720
She was told to sit on it, but she just fell on the floor like the chair!

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:24.910
What made you assume that pose?

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:27.320
I decided...

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:32.050
that if I had been sitting on the chair when it fell, I'd have fallen over with it...

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:45.850
I guess that wasn't the right answer.

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:51.170
Before we start our rehearsals, I have an announcement to make.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:54.350
The role of the nursemaid, formerly played by Asae Yuuki, will now be played by...

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.920
Maya Kitajima!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.600
Are you serious?

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:04.140
The show is three days away!

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:07.390
Pipe down! I've made my decision!

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.800
Asae!

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:13.360
I expect you to do your best.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.840
This is your script.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.460
But didn't this role belong to...

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:18.520
Don't worry about her.

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:22.560
If you fail, I'll cut you as well, so keep that in mind.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.570
I'll try my very best!

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.620
Miss Harada!

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:32.370
This'll be a good wake-up call for that egotistical girl.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:36.260
Mr. Suzuki. As an actor, you must have noticed...

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.400
the pose she struck earlier.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.030
Well, it's impossible to sit on an overturned chair.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.010
So, she fell over as well.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:50.010
It's an absurd idea, but it was the only solution...

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:55.040
Being on stage is like being in a scrum: you never know what's going to happen next.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.930
You need to be able to analyze a situation quickly,

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:01.600
and have the bravery and insight to continue acting.

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:06.550
Ms. Tsukikage said she was not able to play the role of the Scarlet Angel yet.

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:08.580
Which suggests that even though...

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:13.260
it's impossible for her at this point in time, if she keeps improving, she will be ready for the role one day.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:19.940
I did it! I'm acting again! Another door has opened for me!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.150
You're telling me that you just waltzed in and she gave you a role?!

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.250
You're normally really shy,

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:31.300
but you went to a major troupe and won them over!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:36.680
I guess when acting's involved, you can do all kinds of unexpected things!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:42.070
Mr. or Mrs. Purple Rose...

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:45.230
You paid for our tutor's hospital fees.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:47.690
I wish I could meet you and say thank you.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:52.610
The main character is a girl who marries into an old country family during the Meiji era.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:56.820
Caught between her loveless husband and her pompous relatives,

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.770
she experiences an awakening as a woman and as a human being,

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:03.670
and ends up falling in love and eloping with a laborer.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:07.430
It's a tale that depicts the many vicissitudes of life.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:10.550
So I'm playing the nursemaid of this household, right?

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:13.810
Yes. She's the ill-bred daughter of an impoverished farmer.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.710
Have you ever heard and tried speaking in a farmer's accent before?

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:19.740
No, this will be my first time!

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:23.530
Why would Miss Harada pick her over me?

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:26.030
She can't be better than me!

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:30.540
I won't let her get away with this!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.180
I haven't seen you in a while, Miss Harada!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.610
Yes, it's certainly been a long time, Mrs. Himekawa.

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:49.050
And you've been progressing steadily, Ayumi...

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.090
What is your latest show?

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:54.120
I'm in <i>The Prince and the Pauper</i>.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.750
But that's two roles, isn't it?

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:59.790
Are you telling me that you're playing both roles?

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:03.530
My daughter has her eyes firmly set on starring in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:08.250
To that end, she has said she'd like to play a variety of roles to perfect her acting skills.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.600
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.990
It seems that my own daughter is now my rival!

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:16.750
Then, I suppose you should start counting someone else among your rivals.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:17.480
What do you mean?

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:20.640
A very interesting girl has recently graced our stage.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.490
Her name is Maya Kitajima.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:28.970
I have been told that Ms. Tsukikage herself considers her a candidate for the lead role in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.640
A candidate?

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:35.430
Maya Kitajima is a candidate for the role of the Scarlet Angel?

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.880
I don't want to lose to her!

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:41.690
The Scarlet Angel is the spirit of a plum tree; an ethereal beauty.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:45.140
Why would anyone consider such an ordinary girl as a candidate for the role?

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.480
Pass.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.300
Mr. Masumi...

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:13.330
The Prince and The Pauper

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.920
Ayumi!

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:06.300
Oh yeah, her play opens on the same day as ours.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.220
Man, why are there people like her?

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:16.520
She's pretty, smart and from a wealthy family...{copied from ep 9 but may be different here?} I'm so envious.

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:20.390
She has all the things I don't.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.920
That's Ayumi!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:50.040
I refuse to lose to <i>you</i>, Maya Kitajima.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.680
I'm going to improve as much as I can.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:57.940
And I'll show Ms. Tsukikage that I'm the only person who's worthy...

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.390
of the starring role in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.360
She's surprised even our troupe.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:09.410
Lately, Ayumi... she's been scaring people.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.900
But she's already so talented...

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:14.950
I don't understand why she feels she has to push herself so hard.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:20.380
Well, according to the rumors, she really wants to get her hands on the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:23.650
She wants to play the Scarlet Angel?

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:31.630
My little girl's such a huge fan of Ayumi Himekawa that she pestered me to bring her!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.910
Ayumi's so pretty!

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.380
What?

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:50.850
Yuck!

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:55.460
I'm so hungry!

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:01.140
Kind sir!

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:04.920
Please help a starvin' soul!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.230
Please, sir!

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:08.960
Get off of me, boy!

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:11.490
I have nothing for you!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.990
Please, Master!

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:16.870
I ain't had a bite to eat for three days now!

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:18.300
Give me a coin!

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.130
Get away from me!

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:31.700
All I wanted was one little coin... you coulda just given me a coin.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.220
You asshole!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:38.090
I hope you die and go to hell!

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:41.300
I can't believe that horrible kid is actually Ayumi Himekawa...

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.370
She looks so dirty...

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:51.040
How can anyone be so bad at sellin' junk?

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.230
Is that you, Pops?

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:56.060
If you haven't sold anythin', you'll get no supper!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:14:00.010
I can't believe that's Ayumi Himekawa up there! I want to go home!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.050
Shush!

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.950
I knew this was going to bomb.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:10.060
The kids just can't see past the image of Ayumi as a beautiful young lady.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:23.500
That's it, Pops! If you want me to go beggin', I'll go beggin'.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.450
Ladies and gentlemen, left and right!

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:33.600
Won't you bless me with yer alms?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.810
Ayumi!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:38.190
Ladies and gentlemen, left and right!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:41.600
Won't you bless me with yer alms?

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:47.280
You're givin' this to me?

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:50.460
Thanks!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.340
The name's Tom! Pleasure to make yer acquaintance!

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:54.690
Here!

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:56.300
Have this, too!

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:57.970
And this!

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.870
I would never have guessed that the haughty Ayumi...

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:06.250
would play to an audience like that!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:09.430
But look! People have stopped leaving!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:13.670
Everyone's been so kind! Thanks!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:18.230
There're still some decent people left in the world after all!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:22.460
Look, Pops! I got all this coin!

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:24.280
So you have. You'll get yer supper tonight!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.020
The rest should be easy from here on out.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.660
The River Woman

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.380
There are only adults in the audience...

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.100
That's a first for me...

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:56.990
I want you to test the waters and see just how far the audience is willing to accept your acting.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:02.600
I've never thought about the target audience before...

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.110
What should I do?

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.310
Wait a minute. Ayumi's play opens tonight as well.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.510
I'm putting on her mask...

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.790
Nursemaid Tazu's mask.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:41.370
Mistress, this is my daughter, Tazu.

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.290
Hey, introduce yourself.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:46.890
Wotcha, I'm Tazu! Pleasure meetin' ya!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.900
Nice place ya got 'ere!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:52.360
Never been to a fancy place like this afore!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:56.840
They say you can 'ave three bowls o' rice if you wanna... that true?

00:16:56.960 --> 00:17:00.830
Indeed. But you must work hard.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:03.540
Oh, I will!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.510
Come over here!

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:14.350
That's strange... why are they all laughing?

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.210
I'm just walking normally...

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.860
Her walk...

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:27.390
Why does she stand out so much on stage when she's so ordinary in real life?

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:28.910
That girl scares me.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:39.270
I desire nothing more than to leave behind these castle walls and play outside! Just once!

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:44.510
I want to see the real world without the interference of the servants.

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.650
What a lovely kid!

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:49.520
Is this really the same person who played Tom?

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:52.370
The Prince's mask and Tom's mask...

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:54.610
She never reveals her real self.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:58.150
She's quite the actress.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:03.520
What's all the commotion?

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:06.460
Indeed, what could it be?

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:13.830
Now, tell us the truth: what were you doing, urchin?!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:17.250
Tell me why you were climbing over the metal fence!

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.840
I weren't doing nothin'!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:25.100
The castle just looked so pretty an' I wanted to see it up close!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.630
She's fast! When did she change?!

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:30.570
But you're so filthy!

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.830
I want you to take this boy for a wash!

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:43.260
Hey! Hey! I've never taken a bath in my life!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.360
I'm gonna die!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:50.710
He seems like a fairly interesting boy and he's the same age as me.

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:55.720
I'm sure he can tell me all kinds of interesting things about life outside the palace!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.720
Hey, look at the kids!

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:02.590
They're no longer looking at Ayumi to watch a beautiful girl in action...

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:06.770
They want to know what's going to happen between Tom and the Prince.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:13.200
She's captured the audience. What will she do next to further her talents?

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:15.040
I can't wait!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:19.410
What do you mean the doll has disappeared?!

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:21.420
I could have sworn I left it in here!

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:23.340
How can it just disappear?!

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.010
It was in the dressing room.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.800
Hurry!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.420
Thanks!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:36.190
<i>Sleep, sleep, little child</i>!

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.670
That girl...

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:39.670
That's Tazu!

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:42.190
Man, bein' a nursemaid sure is borin'...

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:44.450
They jus' make me work all the time.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.020
And I only get one bowl o' chow,

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:52.770
when they said they'd give me three bowls o' rice...

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:54.830
Being on stage is like being in a scrum...

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:57.050
I hope you're ready, Maya Kitajima!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:01.750
After all the humiliation and tears, you'll never want to stand on the stage again!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.270
Oh no!

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:30.290
I guess watchin' a kid ain't as hard as I thought!

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.480
She's really got guts.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.740
She's no ordinary girl!

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.060
Are you all right?

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.170
Someone bring some water!

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:54.220
I can't believe it!

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:56.680
That was a very foolish thing you just did.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:21:01.310
Ironically, all you've managed to do was to help her captivate the audience.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:07.040
With your little sideshow, she made the role of Tazu her own.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.300
What's that girl's name?

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:17.770
I don't know... She's not even listed in the program.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.550
I want you to find out who she is.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:23.680
But why are you so interested in her?

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:27.350
She seems interesting.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:31.460
Having someone like that over at our place could be fun.

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:37.490
On two different stages, both Ayumi Himekawa and Maya Kitajima...

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:40.530
have captivated their audiences.

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:49.990
However, Maya has no idea that she is coming closer and closer to fulfilling her destiny.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
Asa kara yoru made yoru kara asa made

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
From morning until night, from dusk till dawn,

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
Futari ai no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
you can feel the warmth of our love.

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
Shunkashuutou mo ippun ichibyou mo

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
All year round, every minute and every second,

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
Futari hada no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
you can feel the warmth of our skin.

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
Kono dokidoki wa makka ni moeru taiyou

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
This excitement is burning brightly like the sun,

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
Atsuku moete atsuku togashite

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
let us burn brightly, let us burn until we're hot

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
Koi wo shimashou!

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
and make love!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Sunao na mama dakiaou!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Let's hold and be true to each other!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
Isso mekimeki nekki! mekimeki daisuki!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
And let's add more heat! I love the heat!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Aishiae!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Feel the love!

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:27.470
Little one, you have a talent for stealing the show every time you step on stage.

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:31.440
Yes, so great is that talent, other actors feel envious or ignored around you.

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:36.310
But directors who want their plays to speak to the hearts and minds of their audiences...

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:38.660
will put you on stage.

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:43.530
So, your next role is Catherine from <i>Wuthering Heights</i> and you're performing at the Touyou Theater?

00:23:43.530 --> 00:23:46.710
Truth is, I also have an illustrious role set aside for you.

00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:49.810
A role that will touch your heart.

00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 16 - Stage Storm
